    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364520/extras/4aed36da552e3690bda9039a85b0b5d0.avif?t=1755278838\" width=1280 height=383 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this heartwarming Visual Novel, you will aid two of your new classmates\u00a0while also getting to know them better.  Explore the world of improv theater, tease the group's Tsundere, learn about their backstory, and work together to create your own Visual Novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Scenes from the Heart</i></strong> is a classic Visual Novel about a mature but lonely boy (you) who struggles to connect with others due to his superiority complex. His life changes when he befriends Chisaki Namichi, who faces bullying for her unique eye color at elementary school. Together, they later discover Konaka Motomi, a new transferred classmate with her own quirks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they bond, Konaka introduces improvisation theater to Chisaki and you. Inspired, Chisaki initiates her long dream of a visual novel development project, involving the player and Konaka. Despite initial conflicts during the process, they succeed and win an award for their demo, as a menacing shadow is watching over them, hinting at challenges ahead...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- - - - - - - - - - -\u00a0- - - - - - - - - - -\u00a0- - - - - - - - - - -\u00a0- - - - - - - - - - -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story will be split into <u>two</u> parts:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Part 1</strong> is more like a prologue to introduce the starting point and the main cast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Part 2</strong>\u00a0(<strong>TBA</strong>) will be diving deeper into everyday life and branching the story at a certain point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- - - - - - - - - - -\u00a0- - - - - - - - - - -\u00a0- - - - - - - - - - -\u00a0- - - - - - - - - - -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364520/extras/8f793d4cb99730b9a7dae8d14bd63d9e.avif?t=1755278838\" width=400 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approx. 2 hours long</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements (both in-game &amp; Steam achievements) + a gallery to see all of them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 languages available for UI &amp; dialogue: English, Finnish and Japanese</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changing title screen's background image (changes at certain &quot;check&quot; points as you progress through the story)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full English VO</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-life philosophies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Easter Eggs hidden on the story and can be spotted from the backgrounds</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364520/extras/68f3f0bf50ba6487d884d7d44ee1c8ba.avif?t=1755278838\" data-has-big width=800 height=906 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364520/extras/72a322d7b029e5b76d5c12c1671b71c9.avif?t=1755278838\" data-has-big width=800 height=906 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364520/extras/1dd9c507acfa951173baab3bac001a92.avif?t=1755278838\" data-has-big width=800 height=906 /></span></p>",
